Version 1.03 (October 1, 2026)
------------------------------
* Converted to native nftables for Arno's (NFT) Firewall (rules in table inet anf)
* Rules are no longer removed when stopping, (re)start and stop replace the whole ruleset atomically
* The rules are generated by nat_loopback_rules(); on an external IP change both NAT_LOOPBACK chains
  are rebuilt in one atomic update (instead of replacing rules by number)

Version 1.02 (February 2, 2019)
-------------------------------
* Remove unused for-loops

Version 1.01 (July 12, 2016)
----------------------------
+ Add support for NAT_IF requiring AIF 2.0.1g or later

Version 1.00 BETA (October 15, 2012)
------------------------------------
+ Initial version

